# JAXB as System.Xml.Serialization: the binding of a type is what JaxbXmlSerialization adds to it, a public property
# per bound field that carries XmlSerializer's attributes; an XmlAdapter is the compatibility library's JavaXmlAdapter,
# which those properties call.
mapping jaxb:xml-serialization
compat JavaXml.cs
pascal jakarta.xml.bind.annotation.adapters.XmlAdapter -> JavaXmlAdapter using Maddi.JavaCompat
pascal javax.xml.bind.annotation.adapters.XmlAdapter -> JavaXmlAdapter using Maddi.JavaCompat
